  "summary": "Hands in the straps: as the arms press down to the carriage, straight legs lift up and over the head; the spine then rolls down as the arms return.",
  "steps": [
    "Headrest down. Lie on the back, hands in the short loops with arms up, legs long at about 45°.",
    "Breathe in to press the arms to the carriage and lift the legs to the ceiling.",
    "Breathe out to roll over until the legs are level with the floor.",
    "Breathe in to roll down bone by bone; lower the legs as the arms lift."
